<title>USA: Sportsman's sees 1996 profit over $2 mln.</title>
<headline>Sportsman's sees 1996 profit over $2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sportsman's Guide Inc said Wednesday it expected to report earnings of more than $2.0 million for 1996, compared with a loss of $1.7 million for the year ended December 29, 1995.</p>
<p>The company said its preliminary 1996 results indicated that sales would exceed its 1995 revenue of $101.8 million.</p>
